5. SEQUENCE RULES - 'after X, customers add Y'
==============================================================================

  This is Example B from your spec: 'customers who take a
  mortgage add insurance within 60 days'. We can finally test it.

  Ranked by LIFT = confidence / base rate.
  Lift 1.0 means the rule tells you nothing you didn't already know
  from the product's overall popularity. Higher is a real pattern.

